# Copyrighted / personal course material (lecture slides, exam papers, exercise
# sheets, personal exam submissions & grades, and the verbatim text the pipeline
# extracts from them). The pipeline reads these locally; the repo only ships the
# code that processes them, never the source material itself.
Courses/**/lectures/
Courses/**/exercises/
Courses/**/exams/
Courses/**/anki/
Courses/**/candidates/
Courses/**/parsed/

